{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19925","headline":"游城南韩氏庄 · 孟郊","name":"游城南韩氏庄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"初疑潇湘水，锁在朱门中。\n时见水底月，动摇池上风。\n清气润竹林，白光连虚空。\n浪簇霄汉羽，岸芳金碧丛。\n何言数亩间，环泛路不穷。\n愿逐神仙侣，飘然汗漫通。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19925.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19925","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}